        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\overrightarrow{PQ}=\\overrightarrow{SR}$ and $\\overrightarrow{QP}=\\overrightarrow{RS}$.",
          "worked": "Opposite sides are equal in length and parallel, so $\\overrightarrow{PQ}=\\overrightarrow{SR}$ is true, and reversing both gives $\\overrightarrow{QP}=\\overrightarrow{RS}$.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{QR}=\\overrightarrow{PS}$, so $\\overrightarrow{QR}=\\overrightarrow{SP}$ is false (opposite directions). Likewise $\\overrightarrow{PS}=-\\overrightarrow{RQ}$, so the fourth statement is false.",
